  "frozenArchitecturalPrinciples": [
    "player and AI use the same physical/economic capability model",
    "roles emerge from geometry, budgets, technology and logistics rather than class-name bonuses",
    "all authoritative physical values use SI units",
    "modules share one integration contract and contribute to common ship budgets",
    "detection, classification, tracking and fire-control are distinct information states",
    "damage changes real subsystem capabilities instead of applying generic debuffs",
    "world scale, combat scale, sensor scale and logistics cadence use one physical coordinate/time meaning",
    "fictional shields and FTL remain explicit energy/mass/power/heat/time systems rather than free magic ratings"
  ],
